msgid "Teleoperating"
msgstr "Teleoperation"

msgid "Camera views and joint signals from SO-101 teleoperation in Rerun."
msgstr "Rerun에서 보는 SO-101 teleoperation의 camera view와 joint signal입니다."

msgid "What Do I Need for This Module?"
msgstr "이 Module에 필요한 준비물"

msgid ""
"Hands-on. You'll need the calibrated SO-101 robot, leader arm, both cameras, and the Docker "
"container running from [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md)."
msgstr ""
"실습입니다. Calibration된 SO-101 robot과 leader arm, camera 두 대, [Calibrating the SO-101](07"
"-calibrating-so101.md)에서 실행한 Docker container가 필요합니다."

msgid "In this session, you'll teleoperate the SO-101 using the leader arm."
msgstr "이 session에서는 leader arm으로 SO-101을 teleoperate합니다."

msgid ""
"This will give you a sense of the task difficulty by doing it yourself, and also understand how "
"demonstrations can be collected by operators."
msgstr "직접 task를 수행하며 난이도를 체감하고, operator가 demonstration을 수집하는 방법을 이해합니다."

msgid "We'll also configure cameras, and run teleoperation with live camera views in Rerun."
msgstr "Camera를 설정하고 Rerun의 live camera view를 보며 teleoperation도 진행합니다."

msgid ""
"Make sure you have completed [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md) first. You'll need"
" a calibrated robot and the Docker container running with environment variables set."
msgstr ""
"먼저 [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md)을 완료하세요. Robot calibration을 마치고 environment "
"variable을 설정한 Docker container가 실행 중이어야 합니다."

msgid ""
"If you encounter hardware issues during this session, see the [Troubleshooting "
"Guide](troubleshooting.md) for solutions to common problems."
msgstr "Hardware 문제가 발생하면 [Troubleshooting Guide](troubleshooting.md)를 확인하세요."

msgid "Learning Objectives"
msgstr "학습 목표"

msgid "By the end of this session, you'll be able to:"
msgstr "이 session을 마치면 다음을 수행할 수 있습니다."

msgid "**Teleoperate** the robot using the leader arm"
msgstr "Leader arm을 사용한 robot **teleoperation**"

msgid ""
"**Configure** cameras so you can teleoperate using the same camera views our AI models will use, "
"and Rerun for debugging"
msgstr "AI model과 같은 camera view로 teleoperate하도록 camera를 **설정**하고 Rerun으로 debugging"

msgid "Safety"
msgstr "안전"

msgid "Before powering on or running policies:"
msgstr "전원을 켜거나 policy를 실행하기 전에:"

msgid ""
"**Pinch hazard:** The gripper and moving joints can trap fingers. Keep hands clear of the "
"follower arm while motors are enabled, and keep fingers away from the leader arm’s joints as you "
"guide it."
msgstr ""
"**Pinch hazard:** Gripper와 움직이는 joint에 손가락이 끼일 수 있습니다. Motor가 활성화된 동안 follower arm에 손을 가까이하지 말고, "
"leader를 움직일 때도 joint에서 손가락을 멀리 두세요."

msgid "Verify cables are routed to avoid snagging during motion."
msgstr "움직일 때 cable이 걸리지 않도록 배선을 확인합니다."

msgid "Be ready to stop execution with **CTRL+C** or unplug power cables if needed."
msgstr "필요하면 **CTRL+C**로 실행을 중단하거나 전원 cable을 뽑을 수 있도록 준비합니다."

msgid "Re-check workspace placement after moving any equipment."
msgstr "장비를 옮긴 뒤에는 workspace 배치를 다시 확인합니다."

msgid "Teleoperation (no cameras)"
msgstr "Camera 없는 Teleoperation"

msgid "Now that both arms are calibrated, we're ready to begin teleoperating!"
msgstr "두 arm의 calibration을 마쳤으므로 teleoperation을 시작할 수 있습니다!"

msgid "First, let's just use our eyes - no cameras."
msgstr "먼저 camera 없이 눈으로 직접 보며 진행합니다."

msgid ""
"**Position both arms in similar poses before starting teleoperation.** The follower will move to "
"match the leader arm."
msgstr "**Teleoperation을 시작하기 전에 두 arm의 pose를 비슷하게 맞추세요.** Follower가 leader와 같은 pose로 이동합니다."

msgid "**Begin** the teleoperation process."
msgstr "Teleoperation을 **시작**합니다."

msgid "**Move** the leader arm and watch how the follower arm moves to match."
msgstr "Leader arm을 **움직여** follower가 따라 움직이는지 확인합니다."

msgid "**Try** to pick up a vial and place it in the rack!"
msgstr "Vial을 집어 rack에 넣어 **보세요**!"

msgid "**Press Ctrl+C** in the terminal to stop the teleoperation."
msgstr "Terminal에서 **Ctrl+C를 눌러** teleoperation을 중단합니다."

msgid "Camera Setup"
msgstr "Camera 설정"

msgid "The teleoperation you just did used an incredible vision system: your human perception system."
msgstr "방금 teleoperation에서는 사람의 시각 인지 능력을 사용했습니다."

msgid ""
"Our AI model will not have this information, so we need to use the cameras instead when we "
"collect demonstrations."
msgstr "AI model에는 이 정보가 없으므로 demonstration 수집 시에는 camera를 사용해야 합니다."

msgid "Each robot workspace today is equipped with **two cameras**:"
msgstr "각 robot workspace에는 **camera 두 대**가 있습니다."

msgid "**Gripper camera**: Mounted on the robot's wrist, just before the gripper"
msgstr "**Gripper camera**: Gripper 바로 앞, robot wrist에 장착"

msgid "**External camera**: Stationary camera viewing the workspace from the side"
msgstr "**External camera**: Workspace를 측면에서 바라보는 고정 camera"

msgid ""
"Because the policy works off of these visual images, camera assignment is critical to policy "
"performance. If they are swapped, the policy will fail."
msgstr "Policy는 이 image를 기반으로 동작하므로 camera 할당이 성능에 매우 중요합니다. 둘이 바뀌면 policy가 실패합니다."

msgid "Why Two Cameras?"
msgstr "Camera 두 대가 필요한 이유"

msgid "The gripper camera becomes partially occluded after the robot grasps an object like a vial."
msgstr "Robot이 vial 같은 물체를 잡으면 gripper camera가 일부 가려집니다."

msgid ""
"And to place the vial vertically into the rack, the camera is pointed more at the walls of the "
"lightbox than the target rack."
msgstr "Vial을 rack에 세워 넣을 때는 camera가 목표 rack보다 lightbox 벽 쪽을 더 많이 향합니다."

msgid ""
"The external camera provides continuous visibility of the workspace throughout the entire "
"manipulation sequence, ensuring the policy always has usable visual input even when the gripper "
"camera is blocked."
msgstr ""
"External camera는 전체 manipulation 과정에서 workspace를 계속 보여줍니다. Gripper camera가 가려져도 policy가 사용할 수 있는 "
"시각 입력을 제공합니다."

msgid "Finding Available Cameras"
msgstr "사용 가능한 Camera 찾기"

msgid "Similar to the port finder, LeRobot has a tool for identifying available cameras."
msgstr "Port finder와 마찬가지로 LeRobot에는 사용 가능한 camera를 찾는 도구가 있습니다."

msgid "We need to determine the id of both the camera on the robot, and the external stationary camera."
msgstr "Robot의 camera와 고정 external camera의 ID를 각각 확인해야 합니다."

msgid "**Make sure** the two cameras' USB cables are plugged into your computer."
msgstr "두 camera의 USB cable이 computer에 연결되어 있는지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Run** the command:"
msgstr "다음 명령을 **실행**합니다."

msgid ""
"This command captures an image from each available camera, allowing you to determine the index of"
" each camera."
msgstr "각 camera에서 image를 capture하므로 어떤 index가 어느 camera인지 확인할 수 있습니다."

msgid ""
"The command reports camera indices and saves preview images under `outputs/captured_images`. Use "
"the printed paths to inspect the images."
msgstr "명령은 camera index를 출력하고 `outputs/captured_images`에 preview image를 저장합니다. 출력된 경로에서 image를 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"**Open the captured images** by running this command **outside the container**, in a host "
"terminal at the repository directory:"
msgstr "**Container 밖**의 host terminal에서 repository directory로 이동해 다음 명령으로 **capture image를 엽니다**."

msgid "The container's `outputs/` directory is mounted there, so these are the images you just captured."
msgstr "Container의 `outputs/`가 여기에 mount되어 있으므로, 방금 capture한 image가 표시됩니다."

msgid ""
"**Open** each image and **note** which index corresponds to the wrist and stationary camera. For "
"instance, `opencv__dev_video0.png` indicates an index of `0`."
msgstr ""
"각 image를 **열어** wrist와 stationary camera에 해당하는 index를 **기록**하세요. 예를 들어 `opencv__dev_video0.png`의 "
"index는 `0`입니다."

msgid ""
"Camera preview windows with index 0 circled in the wrist image filename and index 4 circled in "
"the external image filename."
msgstr "Wrist image filename의 index 0과 external image filename의 index 4를 표시한 camera preview입니다."

msgid ""
"In this example, camera **0** is the wrist view and camera **4** is the external view. Use the "
"indices from your own captured images."
msgstr "이 예시에서는 **0**이 wrist, **4**가 external camera입니다. 반드시 본인의 capture image에서 확인한 index를 사용하세요."

msgid ""
"At the same container prompt, **assign** these environment variables using the indices you "
"verified:"
msgstr "같은 container prompt에서 확인한 index로 environment variable을 **설정**합니다."

msgid "**Camera Index Warning**"
msgstr "**Camera Index 주의사항**"

msgid ""
"Camera indices may change any time cameras are unplugged or replugged into your computer, "
"typically when more than one is unplugged at a time."
msgstr "Camera를 분리하거나 다시 연결하면 index가 바뀔 수 있습니다. 특히 여러 camera를 동시에 분리했을 때 자주 발생합니다."

msgid ""
"If you see unexpected behavior during policy execution, camera index reassignment is a common "
"cause."
msgstr "Policy 실행 중 예상과 다른 동작이 나타나면 camera index 변경이 흔한 원인입니다."

msgid ""
"Having camera or hardware issues?  See the [Troubleshooting Guide](troubleshooting.md), also "
"available on the sidebar, for common solutions and detailed diagnostic steps."
msgstr ""
"Camera나 hardware 문제는 sidebar의 [Troubleshooting Guide](troubleshooting.md)에서 해결 방법과 자세한 진단 절차를 "
"확인하세요."

msgid "See the [Quick Reference](quick_reference.md) for common commands."
msgstr "자주 사용하는 명령은 [Quick Reference](quick_reference.md)에 있습니다."

msgid "Teleoperation With Cameras"
msgstr "Camera를 사용하는 Teleoperation"

msgid ""
"Now that we have the camera indices, we can run teleoperation with the real cameras in your "
"workspace."
msgstr "Camera index를 확인했으므로 workspace의 실제 camera와 함께 teleoperation을 실행합니다."

msgid ""
"**Put both arms in similar positions before starting.** The follower arm will move to match the "
"leader when teleoperation starts, so keep clear of its path."
msgstr "**시작 전에 두 arm의 위치를 비슷하게 맞추세요.** Teleoperation이 시작되면 follower가 leader에 맞춰 이동하므로 경로를 비워 두세요."

msgid "Rerun Viewer Teleop Example"
msgstr "Rerun Viewer Teleoperation 예시"

msgid ""
"This will launch the teleoperation interface. You should see two cameras, one on the wrist and "
"one externally mounted on the lightbox. Make sure your camera views and props roughly match this "
"setup."
msgstr ""
"Teleoperation interface가 열립니다. Wrist camera와 lightbox에 고정된 external camera가 보여야 합니다. Camera view와"
" 소품 배치를 이 예시와 비슷하게 맞추세요."

msgid "This is a valuable tool for both teleoperation and debugging."
msgstr "Teleoperation과 debugging에 모두 유용한 도구입니다."

msgid ""
"Now using the **Rerun** viewer that opened, **try** picking up vials and placing them in the rack"
" **only using the camera views**, not your eyes. See if you can perform the task a few times."
msgstr ""
"열린 **Rerun** viewer에서 **camera view만 사용해** vial을 집어 rack에 넣어 보세요. Workspace를 직접 보지 말고 몇 차례 성공할 수 "
"있는지 확인합니다."

msgid ""
"We'll spend some time here - try to do several picks. Emphasize smooth, direct movements. Don't "
"hesitate, move with intention."
msgstr "여기서 시간을 들여 여러 번 시도하세요. 부드럽고 직접적인 움직임에 집중하고, 주저하기보다 목적을 분명히 하며 움직입니다."

msgid "Notice what makes this task challenging:"
msgstr "Task를 어렵게 만드는 요인을 관찰하세요."

msgid "the gripper camera becomes partially occluded after grasp"
msgstr "Grasp 후 gripper camera가 일부 가려집니다."

msgid "the rack requires precise placement"
msgstr "Rack에 정밀하게 배치해야 합니다."

msgid "lack of depth data makes rack alignment difficult"
msgstr "Depth data가 없어 rack 정렬이 어렵습니다."

msgid "**Press Ctrl+C** to stop the teleoperation."
msgstr "**Ctrl+C를 눌러** teleoperation을 중단합니다."

msgid "**Close** the Rerun viewer if it's still open."
msgstr "Rerun viewer가 남아 있으면 **닫습니다**."

msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr "핵심 내용"

msgid "Camera assignment directly affects policy performance"
msgstr "Camera 할당은 policy 성능에 직접 영향을 줍니다."

msgid ""
"Task difficulty - gripper camera becomes occluded after grasp, external camera provides "
"continuous visibility"
msgstr "Grasp 후 gripper camera가 가려지는 반면, external camera는 계속 workspace를 보여줍니다."

msgid "The Rerun viewer is a valuable debugging tool for verifying camera views and robot state"
msgstr "Rerun viewer는 camera view와 robot state를 검증하는 유용한 debugging 도구입니다."

msgid "Resources"
msgstr "참고 자료"

msgid ""
"[SO-101 Getting Started Guide](https://huggingface.co/docs/lerobot/en/so101) — Full assembly, "
"motor setup, and calibration instructions"
msgstr ""
"[SO-101 Getting Started Guide](https://huggingface.co/docs/lerobot/en/so101) — 전체 조립, motor 설정, "
"calibration 안내"

msgid "[Rerun](https://rerun.io/) — A tool for visualizing camera views and robot actions"
msgstr "[Rerun](https://rerun.io/) — Camera view와 robot action visualization 도구"

msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "다음 단계"

msgid ""
"Continue to [Domain Randomization](10-domain-randomization.md) to see how we vary the simulated "
"scene before practicing and collecting demonstrations."
msgstr ""
"[Domain Randomization](10-domain-randomization.md)에서 실습과 demonstration 수집 전에 simulation scene을 "
"변화시키는 방법을 살펴보세요."

